      "filename": "Former RAF Houses, Church Fenton, North Yorkshire - geograph.org.uk - 313789.jpg",
      "title": "File:Former RAF Houses, Church Fenton, North Yorkshire - geograph.org.uk - 313789.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0d/Former_RAF_Houses%2C_Church_Fenton%2C_North_Yorkshire_-_geograph.org.uk_-_313789.jpg",
